   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Rocket Man (I Think It's Going to Be a Long, Long Time)**: back after 61 archived shows (1395 days); rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Mother**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2016-10-26** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 159 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Heard as a stream on a six-hour drive home, the audience noise on the recording did not intrude [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A couple spent their anniversary at the show, traveling from central Miss to Tennessee; they found the theater beautiful [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2016-10-26**: taped by willsfc; transferred by willsfc; source: Avantone CK-1 (cardoid) > Fostex FR-2LE [1]",
